WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000 line:-3
Inside the booth: a README open in an app.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.500 line:-3
Select a paragraph and copy it, inside the booth.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.800 line:-3
Open the Clipboard panel. The copied text is already in the box.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000 line:-3
Select all in the box and copy it. Now your computer has it.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000 line:-3
On your computer: paste into the editor.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000 line:-3
The booth's text is now on your computer.
